WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.070
For a whole month, Muslims around the
world eat and drink nothing from dawn to

2
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.270
sunset.

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.510
The month moves about 11
days earlier each year,

4
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.240
so sometimes the fast
falls in long summer days.

5
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:18.020
Muslims believe the Qur'an's revelation
began in this month, Ramadan.

6
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:22.340
So what can an empty stomach
teach that a full one cannot?

7
00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:25.440
In this mission, you'll
explore the nights of Ramadan,

8
00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.500
and the special night
sought in its last ten.

9
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:33.470
Then you'll see how the month ends,
in a festival of breaking the fast.

10
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:37.960
Your mission: find out what Muslims
believe fasting is really for.
